          "text": "Good progress. Let me now move to the next branch - the endpoints and API surface. The handoff lists 5 endpoints. Let me check if any need refining given our decisions so far.\n\nActually, let me think about what's left to grill:\n\n1. ✅ Entity model (single entity + TriageOutcome embeddable)\n2. ✅ Async vs sync (async + Messenger)\n3. ✅ Status state machine (5 states: pending, processing, awaiting_answer, completed, failed)\n4. ✅ AI response discrimination (JSON `type` field)\n5. ✅ Conversation history shape (drop `role`, keep `type`)\n6. ✅ Turn counting (explicit field)\n\nRemaining branches:\n7. Endpoints — do the 5 listed endpoints make sense with our state machine?\n8. TriageAnalyzer service design — how it calls OpenRouter via HTTP client\n9. The Messenger flow — message design, handler, transport configuration\n10. The system prompt — what it looks like, where it lives\n11. Frontend components — what the interview UI looks like\n12. Testing strategy — mocking AI calls in tests\n\nLet me ask about endpoints next.",
