              "content": "# Task Context: Issue #3 — Triage Interview\n\nSession ID: 2026-05-29-issue3-triage\nCreated: 2026-05-29T00:00:00Z\nStatus: in_progress\n\n## Current Request\n\nImplement Issue #3: Triage Interview — the core feature. Symptom intake UI → AI follow-up questions → triage result. Auth exists from #2.\n\n## Decisions from Grill-with-Docs (17 resolved)\n\n1. **Entity model**: Single `TriageSubmission` entity with `TriageOutcome` Doctrine Embeddable (not separate entity)\n2. **TriageOutcome**: Value object containing `specialist`, `urgency`, `justification` — all nullable as a group\n3. **Async flow**: Messenger-based async processing with frontend polling\n4. **Status machine**: 5 states — `pending → processing → awaiting_answer → processing → ... → completed` (plus `failed`)\n5. **AI response discrimination**: JSON with `{\"type\":\"question\",\"content\":\"...\"}` vs `{\"type\":\"result\",\"specialist\":\"...\",\"urgency\":\"...\",\"justification\":\"...\"}`\n6. **Conversation history**: JSON column, entries have `type` + `content` + `timestamp` (drop `role` — `type` encodes it)\n7. **Turn counting**: Explicit `$currentTurn` int field, incremented on follow_up, force result at turn >= 3\n8. **Endpoints**: 5 endpoints kept — status (light poll) + result (full payload) remain separate\n9. **AI layer**: `OpenRouterClient` (Shared) wraps HTTP, `TriageSystemPrompt` (service), `TriageAnalyzer` (service)\n10. **Frontend flow**: Single-page interview state machine on `/triage`, navigate to `/triage/:id/result` on complete\n11. **Character limits**: Frontend maxLength + backend Validator (hard gate) + system prompt instruction (AI)\n12. **Error strategy**: 3 retries → failed, malformed JSON on turns 1-2 → treat as question, turn 3 force non-compliance → failed\n13. **Hooks**: `useTriageInterview` (main hook) composing `useTriagePolling` internally\n14. **Authorization**: Ownership check on all submission endpoints (403 if user mismatch)\n15. **User relationship**: `ManyToOne` to User entity (pragmatic, User is shared kernel)\n16. **MySubmissionsPage**: DEFERRED to later issue — Issue #3 is interview pipeline only\n17. **Testing**: Unit + Integration + Functional (backend) + Vitest (frontend), 80%+ coverage\n\n## Implementation Order (5 batches)\n\n```\nBatch 1: Foundation\n  - TriageOutcome embeddable + TriageStatus enum\n  - TriageSubmission entity\n  - TriageSubmissionRepository interface + Doctrine impl\n  - Migration\n  - services.yaml binding\n\nBatch 2: AI Layer (after foundation)\n  - OpenRouterClient (in Shared\\Infrastructure\\Ai\\)\n  - TriageSystemPrompt service\n  - TriageAnalyzer service\n\nBatch 3: Pipeline (after AI)\n  - SubmitTriageCommand + Handler\n  - ProcessTriageMessage (Messenger)\n  - Messenger routing config\n\nBatch 4: Controllers (after pipeline)\n  - config/routes/triage.yaml\n  - TriageController (5 endpoints)\n\nBatch 5 (parallel, independent): Frontend\n  - Update types (new status, drop role)\n  - TriagePage (interview state machine)\n  - TriageResultPage\n```\n\n## Context Files (Standards to Follow)\n\n- `/home/stefan/.opencode/context/core/standards/code-quality.md` — MANDATORY coding standards\n- `/home/stefan/dev/projects/triageflow/CONTEXT.md` — Domain glossary (UPDATED: added TriageOutcome)\n- `/home/stefan/dev/projects/triageflow/agents.md` — Master project config\n- `/home/stefan/.opencode/context/core/standards/test-coverage.md` — Testing standards\n- `/home/stefan/.opencode/context/development/principles/clean-code.md` — Clean code\n- `/home/stefan/.opencode/context/development/principles/api-design.md` — REST API patterns\n- `/home/stefan/.opencode/context/ui/web/react-patterns.md` — React patterns\n- `/home/stefan/.opencode/context/core/essential-patterns.md` — Error handling, validation, security\n\n## Reference Files (Source Material)\n\n- `/home/stefan/dev/projects/triageflow/docs/handoffs/triageflow-handoff-issue3.md` — Handoff from Issue #2\n- `/home/stefan/dev/pr