d v4, TanStack Query v5\n\n## Exit Criteria\n\n- [ ] 5 backend endpoint tests pass (submit, answer, status poll, result, ownership 403)\n- [ ] AI response discrimination tests pass (question, result, malformed, turn-3 force)\n- [ ] Entity persistence tests pass (create, conversation append, outcome set, turn increment)\n- [ ] `docker compose run --rm php vendor/bin/phpunit` — all green, 80%+ coverage\n- [ ] Frontend: `npx tsc -b && npx eslint .` — clean\n- [ ] Frontend vitest tests pass\n- [ ] TriagePage: submit → poll → answer → result flow works end-to-end\n- [ ] `backend/agents.md` updated to reflect correct architecture\n"
