                  "summary": "## Task 01: TriageStatus Enum + TriageOutcome Embeddable\n\nCoderAgent created:\n- `src/Triage/Domain/Entity/TriageStatus.php`: PHP 8.4 string-backed enum — Pending, Processing, AwaitingAnswer, Completed, Failed\n- `src/Triage/Domain/Entity/TriageOutcome.php`: Doctrine Embeddable with private constructor, `create()` and `fromAiResult()` factories. Fields: specialist (string), urgency (string), justification (string) — initially had `?string` types with default null.\n- 25 tests (9 status + 16 outcome)\n\nBUG DISCOVERED: 5 tests failed — `new TriageOutcome()` with private constructor. Tests tried to create TriageOutcome with all-null fields (a \"null outcome\" state)."
                },
                {
                  "startId": "m0057",
                  "endId": "m0072",
                  "summary": "## TriageOutcome Fix — User: \"can we just use PHP's ? before variable?\"\n\nUser rejected `TriageOutcome::null()` factory: \"that's something I'd throw another developer out of the window for.\"\n\n**Real fix**: Made TriageOutcome construct from non-nullable `string` types (not `?string`). No default null values. The invariant: a TriageOutcome always has all three fields. Null/no-result is handled by `?TriageOutcome = null` on the parent entity.\n\nGetters changed from `?string` to `string`. `isComplete()` simplified to always return `true` (it only exists when complete).\n\nRemoved 5 null-outcome tests from TriageOutcomeTest.php. Updated 1 ordering test to use timestamp comparison instead of UUID comparison.\n\n**Result**: 23 tests, 42 assertions — all green."
                },
                {
                  "startId": "m0073",
                  "endId": "m0080",
                  "summary": "## Task 02: TriageSubmission Entity\n\nCoderAgent created:\n- `src/Triage/Domain/Entity/TriageSubmission.php` (208 lines): All domain methods — `submit(User, string)` named constructor, `addAiQuestion(string)`, `addUserAnswer(string)`, `completeWithOutcome(TriageOutcome)`, `markFailed()`. UUID v4 PK, ManyToOne to User, json conversationHistory, Embedded TriageOutcome, TriageStatus enum column, currentTurn int (starts 0). Character limits enforced (500/300/1000).\n- 33 tests in TriageSubmissionTest.php\n\nBUG: `testFullInterviewFlowWithThreeTurns` expected 7 conversation entries but `completeWithOutcome` adds a `result` entry → 8 total. Fixed assertion from 7→8 and updated comment: \"initial_description + 3 questions + 3 answers + 1 result = 8\".\n\n**Result**: 54 tests, 136 assertions — all green."
