                  "summary": "## Tasks 03-04: Repository + Migration + Services\n\nCoderAgent created:\n- `src/Triage/Domain/Repository/TriageSubmissionRepository.php`: Interface — save(), findById(), findByUser()\n- `src/Triage/Infrastructure/Repository/DoctrineTriageSubmissionRepository.php`: Extends ServiceEntityRepository, implements interface\n- `migrations/Version20260530120000.php`: Creates triage_submissions table — UUID PK, FK→users, 11 columns including outcome embeddable fields (outcome_specialist, outcome_urgency, outcome_justification)\n- Updated `config/services.yaml` with repository alias binding\n- 5 integration tests\n\nMigrations applied successfully to both main and test DB.\n\nBUG: `testFindByUserReturnsSubmissionsOrderedBySubmittedAtDesc` — `\\usleep(1000)` too small for DB timestamp precision. Also UUID comparison after `$em->clear()` fragile. Fixed: `\\sleep(1)` + verify DESC ordering by comparing `submittedAt` timestamps instead of UUID values.\n\n**Result**: All 5 repo tests green. 5/5 passing, 10 assertions. Batch 1 complete."
