ruction: *\"Do NOT validate specialist/urgency against enums — there are no enums for these in the codebase\"*. The code validates structural completeness (keys exist, non-null) but does not validate against an enum list. The test `testResultWithNullRequiredKeyThrowsException` covers the null-value case.\n</task_result>\n</task>",
