                  "summary": "## Batches 2-3: AI Layer + Pipeline Implementation\n\n### User: \"Proceed. I don't like fallback_model, make it openai/gpt-oss-120b:free\"\n\nUpdated `ai.yaml` fallback model. Delegated Tasks 05-07 to CoderAgent.\n\n### Task 05: OpenRouterClient\nCreated `OpenRouterClient.php` (final readonly) wrapping symfony/http-client — retry logic (3 attempts on TransportException), Authorization headers, configurable timeout/model/tokens/temperature. `OpenRouterException` class. 13 unit tests. Services.yaml updated with `%ai.openrouter.*%` parameter bindings.\n\n### Task 06: TriageSystemPrompt\nCreated `TriageSystemPrompt.php` (final readonly) — static system prompt with specialist list (GENERAL_PRACTITIONER, CARDIOLOGIST, etc.), JSON output format, character limits, demo disclaimer. `buildConversationContext()` maps history types to OpenAI roles (initial_description/answer→user, question/result→assistant). 20 tests.\n\n### Task 07: TriageAnalyzer\nCreated `TriageAnalyzer.php` (final readonly) — `analyzeInitial()` and `analyzeFollowUp()`. JSON discrimination: question vs result. Turn force: at turn >= 3 injects force-result message, throws on non-compliance. Malformed JSON: turns 0-2→wrapped as question, turn 3→exception. `TriageAnalysisFailedException`. No enum validation for specialists/urgency per grilled decision. 20 tests."
                },
                {
                  "startId": "m0119",
                  "endId": "m0143",
                  "summary": "## Batch 2 Fixes: Interface Extraction + Test Bugs\n\n### Bug 1: OpenRouterClient is final — 19 TriageAnalyzer tests fail\n`ClassIsFinalException`: PHPUnit can't mock final classes. **Fix**: extracted `OpenRouterClientInterface` with `chat()` method. Changed TriageAnalyzer constructor to depend on interface. Updated TriageAnalyzerTest to mock interface.\n\n### Bug 2: OpenRouterClientTest failures (2 warnings + 4 errors)\n- **HTTP 500 not caught**: `toArray()` on 500 throws `ServerException` (not `TransportExceptionInterface`). **Fix**: changed catch in `chat()` to `\\Throwable`, re-throw non-Transport errors immediately as `OpenRouterException`.\n- **Undefined array key 'model'**: MockHttpClient normalizes `json` option to `body` in Symfony 7.4. **Fix**: tests now decode `$options['body']` as fallback.\n- **60.0 !== 60**: Float/int mismatch for timeout. **Fix**: cast to `(float)` in assertion.\n- **Header detection**: Normalized headers use `'Authorization: Bearer ...'` format. **Fix**: spy pattern with post-assertion using `assertStringContainsString`.\n\n### After fixes: 135 tests, 320 assertions — all green."
                },
                {
                  "startId": "m0144",
                  "endId": "m0158",
                  "summary": "## Batch 3: Pipeline (Tasks 08-09)\n\n### Task 08: SubmitTriageCommand + Handler\nCreated `SubmitTriageCommand` (DTO: description, user) and `SubmitTriageHandler` (invokable, injects repository + TriageAnalyzer + EM + MessageBus). Flow: validate description ≤500 chars → create entity → persist → call analyzeInitial → question (addAiQuestion + dispatch ProcessTriageMessage) or result (completeWithOutcome) or failure (markFailed). 8 tests. Also created `ProcessTriageMessage` stub (submissionId UUID).\n\n### Task 09: ProcessTriageMessageHandler\nCreated `ProcessTriageMessageHandler` (`#[AsMessageHandler]`, final readonly). Flow: load submission → skip terminal/pending → extract last answer from history → call analyzeFollowUp → question (addAiQuestion) or result (completeWithOutcome) or failure (markFailed). 11 tests.\n\n### Bug: TriageAnalyzer is final — 35 test errors\nSame pattern as OpenRouterClient. **Fix**: extracted `TriageAnalyzerInterface`, changed both handlers + tests to use interface. Also fixed double 'InterfaceInterface' from replaceAll, fixed file paths in structure tests (5-level up → 4-level). Added `OPENROUTER_API_KEY` to phpunit.xml and .env.test for container boots.\n\n### Bug: Container compilation failure in test env\n`%ai.openrouter.*%` parameters not resolving. ai.yaml not loaded. **Fix**: moved parameters into services.yaml directly, removed from ai.yaml. Fixed 16 container-dependent test errors.\n\n### After fixes: 154 tests, 437 assertions — all green."
