t — Docker healthy, health check 200, TS+ESLint clean, Vite builds\n33: \n34: ### Backend Tasks\n35: \n36: **Task 1 — Docker + Symfony scaffold** (`53f1545`):  \n37: `php:8.4-fpm-alpine` Dockerfile (pdo_pgsql + zip), Nginx reverse proxy, `postgres:16-alpine` with healthcheck. Symfony 7.4.13 created via `composer create-project symfony/skeleton:\"7.4.*\"`. Health endpoint at `/health` → 200. Permission fix for `var/cache` + `var/log`.\n38: \n39: **Task 2 — Composer deps + AI + CORS + JWT** (`2546627`):  \n40: symfony/http-client, symfony/messenger, symfony/scheduler, lexik/jwt-authentication-bundle v3.2 (includes security-bundle), nelmio/cors-bundle v2.6.1. No `symfony/ai` package exists → custom `ai.yaml` with OpenRouter params (gemma-4-31b-it:free, fallback llama-2-13b). 4096-bit JWT keypair. .env with CORS_ORIGIN, JWT vars, OPENROUTER_API_KEY.\n41: \n42: **Task 3 — DDD Light Doctrine + PostgreSQL 16** (`f2b2c13`):  \n43: 4 bounded contexts mapped (Triage/User/Admin/Shared). auto_mapping=false, explicit attribute mappings. PostgreSQL 16.14 verified.\n44: \n45: ### Frontend Tasks\n46: \n47: **Task 1 — Vite + React + TS + Tailwind** (`14dbb51`):  \n48: Vite 8 + React 19.2 + TypeScript 6.0 (strict+noUncheckedIndexedAccess+noImplicitOverride). Tailwind CSS 4 via `@tailwindcss/vite` plugin. Custom theme colors (primary, urgency-{low,medium,high,emergency}). Dark mode via `.dark` class. Vitest 4 + jsdom + Testing Library. `VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000`.\n49: \n50: **Task 2 — API client** (`21fb3c1`):  \n51: Axios instance with JWT interceptor (Bearer from localStorage, 401→/login redirect). Full TypeScript types: UserResource, TriageSubmissionResource, ConversationMessage, DashboardStats, etc. Endpoint constants for auth/triage/admin.\n52: \n53: **Task 3 — UI components** (`9219974`):  \n54: 8 components: Button (variant+size+loading), Card, Input (forwardRef+label+error), Badge (8 variant colors), Spinner (3 sizes), Loader, ErrorBoundary (class, override render), EmptyState. All clsx + dark mode. Named exports, readonly props throughout.\n55: \n56: ### Code Review & Fixes\n57: \n58: **5 criticals** (`6afa9e2` backend, `3f90c2b` frontend):  \n59: C1: Removed duplicate `database` service auto-injected by Doctrine recipe  \n60: C2: APP_SECRET placeholder in .env.dev (was exposed real secret)  \n61: C3: `declare(strict_types=1)` on Kernel.php + Schedule.php  \n62: C4: Removed duplicate .env blocks (second JWT block had empty passphrase)  \n63: C5: 401 interceptor skips redirect on `/login` (was killing onError)\n64: \n65: **8 importants** (`3f85060` backend, `afcaef3` frontend):  \n66: I1: security.yaml wired for JWT (login+api firewalls, entity provider, access_control)  \n67: I2: messenger.yaml → async doctrine transport with retry+failure  \n68: I3: ai.yaml documented as custom (symfony/ai-bundle doesn't exist)  \n69: I4: doctrine naming → underscore_number_aware  \n70: I5: composer.json → phpunit+phpstan in require-dev  \n71: I6: package.json → test/typecheck/test:watch scripts  \n72: I7: admin endpoints → added missing /api/ prefix  \n73: I8: ESLint → recommendedTypeChecked+stylisticTypeChecked, vite-env.d.ts\n74: \n75: ### Push Status\n76: \n77: | Repo | Remote | Head |\n78: |------|--------|------|\n79: | Backend | `psswid/triageflow-backend` | `3f85060` |\n80: | Frontend | `psswid/triageflow-frontend` | `afcaef3` |\n81: | Docs | `psswid/triageflow-docs` | up-to-date |\n82: \n83: ### Key Decisions\n84: - **No symfony/ai-bundle** — doesn't exist on Packagist. AI via symfony/http-client directly, documented in ai.yaml ADR comment\n85: - **PHP 8.4** (not plan's 8.2) — composer constraint bumped to `>=8.4`\n86: - **Vite 8 / TS 6** — scaffold picked latest, not plan's Vite 6 / TS 5. All code adjusted.\n87: - **TS override on render() only** — TS 6 + React 19 types don't declare getDerivedStateFromError for override\n88: - **Separate git repos** — backend/ and frontend/ are independent repos (per .gitignore), not submodules. Ea