          "text": "Good, I now have the ADR format. It's minimal — 1-3 sentences plus optional sections when they add value. Both decisions qualify:\n\n1. **ADR-0004: Single aggregate model** — Hard to reverse (schema change), surprising (one entity holds everything), real trade-off (separate table vs embedded)\n2. **ADR-0005: JSON column for conversation** — Hard to reverse (data migration), surprising (no normalized turns table), real trade-off (queryability vs simplicity)\n\nLet me write both following the existing format.",
